  "note": "BTN opens, a blind 3-bets, BTN folds, calls or 4-bets. Pure (PTO) strategy, hand -> 0/1. Fold = neither 4Bet nor Call 3Bet; OpenBTN is the range hero can hold here. Call 5BetBTNvs<seat> (cash100 only) splits the 4-bets: those that call a 5-bet jam are value, the rest bluffs. At 40bb the 4-bet is already all-in, so there is no 5-bet and no split. Sizing profiles (source README): cash100 6-max 100bb no ante, 2.5bb open, 3-bet OOP 5x (12.5bb), 4-bet IP 2x (25bb); mtt40 9-max 40bb, 1bb BB ante, 2.3bb open, 3-bet OOP 4x (9.2bb, cap 10bb), 4-bet all-in. Same repo and caveats as cash-100-pto.json (licence unclear; personal use)."
